## Cell-based source picker (NEW, 2026-08-24)
- Gap closed: RFQ import was fixed-schema (parse_boq hard-coded columns); no
  spreadsheet-cell view or user column→field mapping. Now added:
- `scripts/xlsx-cells.py` — raw cell grid (A1 coords + guessed header row) from
  any xlsx sheet (read_only-safe). Verified: TS SUPPLY sheet = 39,865 cells,
  headerRow 8, full 24-col label map.
- `api/rfq.php::handle_cells` — {file_id} → reads persisted blob (forge\db\Files),
  returns {sheets, active, headerRow, headerLabels, cells}. Verified live.
- `api/rfq.php::handle_build_from_map` — {file_id, sheet, header_row, fields
  map, optional row_filter, type} → re-extracts cells, maps columns→fields,
  creates entities + contains links (G8/D5), each carrying boq_* lineage +
  `cell_refs` (exact source coord per field). Verified: 268 Straight Pipe rows
  built from TS sheet, each with boq_item_no + cell_refs (e.g. G12/A12).
- NEW `components/quote/docs/` (docs.html/js/css) — per-quote Client Docs tab:
  lists uploaded docs (PDF/Excel/CSV/CAD), upload, open spreadsheet → cell grid
  + column→field mapping + optional row filter + "Build items into quote".
  Registered in view.js tabs + view.html v-show. Comp resolves cleanly.
- DRY: reuses file store + entities/links seams, no new DB tables. No destructive
  SQL. Test quote deleted after validation (quotes.delete soft-delete).

## Quote tab restructure (2026-08-24)
- Top-level tabs reordered to the quote lifecycle (what→what→made-from→doing→cost):
  **Docs → Entities → Materials → Process → Cost**. (Was: Overview/Items/Materials/Docs.)
- Docs = client ingress ("what do they want us to quote on") — now FIRST.
- Entities = entity table ("what is it"); label renamed Items→Entities.
- Materials kept ("what we work with / made from") — keep function.
- Process promoted to top-level tab ("what we do to it"); was a sub-view of Items.
- Cost = NEW `components/quote/cost/` ("how much does it cost") — reuses shell
  `totals` + per-entity `costs`; headline total + breakdown cards (material/
  process/on-costs/margin/grand + mass + trade hours) + on-costs + per-item table.
- Overview tab DROPPED (identity shows in header; cost summary now in Cost).
  quote-overview lazy-loader removed. Default tab = docs.
